They will become tougher on average, that's correct.

The problem with an approach of staying on the same level
is that you get items *only* randomly from death drops.
Generally, you need to explore the dungeon to get at least
the loot randomly generated with the level. But specifically
here I suggest not to get deeper for random dungeon items
but for guaranteed items that may be invaluable to continue
your game successfully. BTW, in Sokoban there's also the
scrolls of earth which may, in conjunction with a stack of
rocks, serve as a boulder fort from which you could throw
those projectiles from your safe harbour.

